                                                "sense_id": "651b1f9f-2ed8-3efe-834e-955f551013d9",
                                                "text": "The combination, in a flour bolt, of a reel head having a throat near its outer edge for the passage of the tailings and a series of revolving adjustable beaters, substantially as set forth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2968a56c-c98c-4465-8000-c6adec5431b7",
                                                "sense_id": "651b1f9f-2ed8-3efe-834e-955f551013d9",
                                                "text": "We have a number of these reels in different mills that are bolting the break flour direct from the scalping reels and scalped through No. 8 cloth. […] Now, gentlemen, they require a much less number to do a given amount of work than any other known machine or bolt, and require less space and power."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f64f57c-553d-48e3-91da-d5664fb77a9e",
                                                "sense_id": "651b1f9f-2ed8-3efe-834e-955f551013d9",
                                                "text": "As the material is agitated by the motion of the bolt, the flour falls through, while the smaller particles of bran are taken up by the current of air and carried off."
